Federal Money Given to California for Fire Relief Should Go Directly to Victims — NOT to NGOs

@SpencerPratt explains how Governor Newsom Requested $40 Billion from Congress for LA Fire Aid, but listed NGOs and organizations who would get the money instead of the people who lost homes.

"The list was like a scary comedy movie, it was like the exact FireAid scam... The money that people actually want to help people — It doesn't go to where its supposed to. It goes to salaries, it goes to bonuses,
